# fixture ②/四件套 · 未登录跳转页（ClassifyResult.LOGIN_REDIRECT）
# 出处等级：⚠[DOCS] —— 合成，依详设 URL 模式（oup-silverchair.md §2/§5 + robots 印证
#   `/signin.aspx` 端点存在，publisher-platforms-p4-recheck.md §2）。session 过期/未登录
#   时 OUP 302→signin；此处以「跟随重定向后落到 signin 表单页」形态落盘（final_url 含
#   /signin，status 200，body 为 sign-in 表单、**无账号标识**、**无 article-pdf**）。
# 判定依据：final_url 含 `/signin` 且 body 无账号标识（sign out/my account/signed in as）
#   → LOGIN_REDIRECT → AuthRequired（整批 BLOCKED(auth)，提示 crawler auth login）。
HTTP-STATUS: 200
X-FINAL-URL: https://academic.oup.com/signin?redirectUri=%2Fqje%2Farticle%2F141%2F3%2F2205%2F8662148
content-type: text/html; charset=UTF-8

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><title>Sign In | Oxford Academic</title></head>
<body>
<main><h1>Sign in</h1>
<p>Sign in through your institution, society, or personal account to access this content.</p>
<form action="/signin" method="post">
<label for="username">Email or username</label>
<input id="username" name="username" type="text"/>
<label for="password">Password</label>
<input id="password" name="password" type="password"/>
<button type="submit">Sign in</button>
</form>
<a href="/Shibboleth.sso/Login">Sign in through your institution</a>
</main>
</body></html>
